{
  "name": "dsh-lite-balance",
  "version": "0.3.2",
  "description": "Lightweight, extensible DeepSeek balance display for the dsh web GUI. Replaces the composer stats line with user-configurable modules: turns/steps · duration · speed · cache hit · session tokens · spend+balance · peak/idle, per-request priced & persisted session spend, click-to-top-up. · 轻量、可扩展的 DSH 余额显示器：以可配置模块替换输入框下方统计条（轮次/步数 · 耗时 · 速率 · 缓存命中 · Token 用量 · 消耗+余额 · 高峰/空闲），会话消耗逐笔计价并持久化，点击一键充值。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.zh-CN.md",
    "docs",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "balance",
    "wallet",
    "spend",
    "余额",
    "统计"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Hongwei Bao (https://github.com/hongwbao)",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/hongwbao/dsh-lite-balance.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/hongwbao/dsh-lite-balance/tree/main/packages/dsh-lite-balance",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/hongwbao/dsh-lite-balance/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  }
}
